{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03270","headline":"奉和梁王宴龙泓应教得微字 · 宋之问","name":"奉和梁王宴龙泓应教得微字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水府沦幽壑，星轺下紫微。\n鸟惊司仆驭，花落侍臣衣。\n芳树摇春晚，晴云绕座飞。\n淮王正留客，不醉莫言归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03270.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03270","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}